+Lenik's Changes to Tabler Icons
+================================
+
+This document describes the changes made by Lenik (tabler-icons@bodz.net) in 2026
+to prepare Tabler Icons for Debian packaging.
+
+Changes Made
+------------
+
+### Makefile Enhancements
+
+1. **Added install target**: The Makefile now includes an `install` target that
+   installs SVG and PNG icon files to a configurable location.
+
+2. **PREFIX and DESTDIR support**: The install target respects standard
+   variables:
+   - `PREFIX`: Installation prefix (default: `/usr/local`)
+   - `DESTDIR`: Staging directory for packaging (default: empty)
+   - `pkgdatadir`: Data directory (default: `$(PREFIX)/share/tabler-icons`)
+
+   Usage examples:
+   ```bash
+   make install                          # Installs to /usr/local/share/tabler-icons
+   make install PREFIX=/usr              # Installs to /usr/share/tabler-icons
+   make install DESTDIR=/tmp/staging     # Stages to /tmp/staging/usr/local/share/tabler-icons
+   ```
+
+3. **Installation structure**: The install target creates the following structure:
+   ```
+   $(pkgdatadir)/
+   ├── svg/
+   │   ├── filled/      # Filled SVG icons
+   │   └── outline/      # Outline SVG icons
+   └── png/
+       ├── filled/      # Filled PNG icons (various sizes)
+       └── outline/     # Outline PNG icons (various sizes)
+   ```
+
+### Debian Packaging
+
+Added complete Debian packaging infrastructure:
+
+- **debian/control**: Package metadata and dependencies
+- **debian/changelog**: Package changelog
+- **debian/copyright**: Copyright and license information
+- **debian/rules**: Build rules that use the Makefile install target
+- **debian/source/format**: Source format specification (3.0 quilt)
+
+The Debian package installs icons to `/usr/share/tabler-icons/` as per Debian
+policy.
+
+Contact
+-------
+
+For questions or issues related to these changes:
+- Email: tabler-icons@bodz.net
+- Author: Lenik
+- Year: 2026
+
