+# Claude AI Integration
+
+This file contains information about Claude AI integration with Tabler Icons.
+
+## Overview
+
+Tabler Icons provides a comprehensive set of icons that can be used with Claude AI for various purposes.
+
+## Usage
+
+Icons can be referenced and used in Claude AI conversations and applications.
+
+## Installation
+
+This file is installed as part of the tabler-icons Debian package to `/usr/share/tabler-icons/claude.md`.
